---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import StatTiles from '../../components/StatTiles.astro';
import ModelTable from '../../components/ModelTable.astro';
import evals from '../../data/evals.json';
import { url, HF } from '../../lib/site';

const k = evals.kpi;
---
<Base
  page="previous"
  title="Previous work"
  description="The August 2026 work on the Jetson Thor rig: 150 demonstrations, a π0.5 policy with a frozen backbone, and 79 human-scored rollouts, with the report."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>Previous work, August 2026</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        The first complete system: 150 teleoperated demonstrations on the Jetson Thor rig with three cameras,
        and a π0.5 policy that follows source-to-destination commands.
      </p>
      <p class="intro">
        {`The policy keeps π0.5's vision–language backbone frozen and trains only its action expert. A person scored ` +
          `${k.rollouts} of its rollouts over ${k.scenarios} commands; the numbers below come from that evaluation. ` +
          `The newer π0.5 and FLUX runs, on a workstation with five cameras, are the `}<a href={url('')}>latest work</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>How well it worked</h2>
      <StatTiles />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Everything from August</h2>
      <ul class="links">
        <li>
          <a href={url('previous/results/')}>The evaluation</a>
          <span class="note">Where the takes were lost, command by command, with every scored trial on video.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href={url('previous/data/')}>The datasets</a>
          <span class="note">Versions 1 to 5, how the demonstrations were recorded, and why the policy uses no depth.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href={url('previous/report/')}>The report</a>
          <span class="note">Abstract, PDF and citation.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href={`${HF}/datasets/sari-abdan/vial-sort-v5`}>The 150 demonstrations</a>
          <span class="note">On Hugging Face, in the LeRobot format.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>The policies tried in August</h2>
      <p>Only π0.5 was deployed and evaluated; the others were set up on the same rig and not carried through.</p>
      <ModelTable eras={['paper']} />
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .intro { margin-top: 1rem; }
  .links { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: grid; gap: 1.1rem; }
  .links li { display: grid; gap: 0.15rem; }
  .links li > a { font-size: var(--step-1); font-stretch: 112%; font-weight: 560; width: fit-content; }
</style>
